*** Begin ECU Patch
Key: 001-event-context-channel-model
Title: Build the event, context, and channel model
Purpose: Represent immutable facts, context state, file projection, and transport mapping without embedding an AI execution engine in Context.

*** Begin Context
Events persist typed payloads, links, metadata, and Event Parts. Context remains pure current/previous application data. Channel maps inbound transport data into application-owned Events, while the Agent package becomes a projection layer over the same causal record.
*** End Context

