-Durable handle:
+## Event contract
 
-- `run.runId`
-- `run.status`
-- `run.returnValue`
+Every observable result is an Event. Domain Events carry `domain`, `name`,
+typed payload, logical links, and physical link metadata. Technical Events use
+the `context.*` type namespace and carry operation metadata.
 
